// What the model gives, written by `BLESS=1` (design/19-cases.md).
run 1: Readings { visibility: ByMember, binding_path: AsStated, deferral: Recording, captures: AsStated }, every order
outcome 1
  accepted
  value `&mut r`: &u8
  value R: &u8
  value `first(x)`: &u8
  value x: A
  decision `&mut r`: lend & through &
  decision first: first#0
  check `first(x) <= R`: Ok(Identity)
  check `first.Result <= first(x)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `x ~> first.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  I* of a final state: []
outcome 2
  refused
  value `&mut r`: !
  value R: &u8
  value `first(x)`: &u8
  value x: A
  decision `&mut r`: no result
  decision first: first#0
  check `first(x) <= R`: Ok(Identity)
  check `first.Result <= first(x)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `x ~> first.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  I* of a final state: [completeness `&mut r`]
